me before submitting the ticket.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Edit time submission","app.short_description":"Helps you track time spent on tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Invalid time format, expected {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Time was negative. Resetting to 0.","errors.no_answer":"No time submitted","errors.save_hook":"You need to submit your time on this ticket.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Did you follow the installation instructions for this app and configure both required ticket fields to appear on every ticket form?","errors.setup.solution":'If not, please see <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> and go to your ticket forms management page to finalise the setup.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"The time submitted was too long.","statuses.closed":"c","statuses.hold":"h","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutes","views.main.pause":"Pause","views.main.play":"Play","views.main.reset":"Reset","views.main.timelogs":"Timelog","views.main.timelogs_table.agent