 agent's tickets to discover what's taking up their time and which issues they're experts on.\n\n### Know exactly how and where your team is spending their time\n\nKeep a running log of which support agents have worked on a ticket and how long each interaction lasted. Automatically log the total time spent the second your agent updates a ticket or let them manually enter their time.\n\n### Easy to setup, customize, and use\n\nThe Time Tracking App doesn't require any third party setup or login. Simply customize how the Time Tracking app displays and works for your support team, for a seamless fit into your team's current workflow.\n\n### Report on your time logs and take action\n\nStart reporting right away with easily built custom time tracking reports through Insights. Know exactly what's draining your support team's resources and find the best areas for optimization and improvement.\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).\"","app.name":"Time Tracking","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"The timer pauses when the agent navigates away from the ticket and resumes when the agent is back on the ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Auto pause","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blocks submission of a ticket if an agent is trying to submit a ticket with a time spent value (in seconds) greater than 1209600s (two weeks).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Debug: Block large time spent submissions","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agents can see timelog activity on tickets.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Display timelogs to agents","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"The app will not be shown to agents who do not have the 'Admin' role. This also prevents them from being able to see & edit the time upon submission.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Hide the app from agents","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agents can manually pause or reset the timer.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Display timer controls","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agents can reset the current time spent on a ticket.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Reset current time","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"When changes are made to any fields, a modal will ask if the timer should be resumed.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Resume on changes","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Prompt agents to enter a value in minutes before submitting the ticket","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Simplified time submission","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the total time.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Time Field ID","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the time spent on ticket.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Configuration Field ID","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agents can review and edit their time before submitting the ticket.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Edit time submission","app.short_description":"Helps you track time spent on tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Invalid time format, expected {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Time was negative. Resetting to 0.","errors.no_answer":"No time submitted","errors.save_hook":"You need to submit your time on this ticket.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Did you follow the installation instructions for this app and configure both required ticket fields to appear on every ticket form?","errors.setup.solution":'If not, please see <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> and go to your ticket forms management page to finalize the setup.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"The time submitted was too long.","statuses.closed":"c","statuses.hold":"h","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutes","views.main.pause":"Pause","views.main.play":"Play","views.main.reset":"Reset","views.main.timelogs":"Timelog","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Time","views.main.total_time_spent":"Total time","views.modal.body_with_format":'This is the amount of time ({{time_format}}) you spent on this ticket. Edit the time, if needed, and then click "Submit time".',"views.modal.close":"Cancel","views.modal.count_down":"This modal will automatically close in {{time}} seconds.","views.modal.save":"Submit time","views.resume_modal.body":"Would you like to resume the timer?","views.resume_modal.no":"No","views.resume_modal.yes":"Yes","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Export CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"No timelogs