ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"¿Siguió las instrucciones de instalación para esta aplicación y configuró los dos campos de ticket requeridos para que aparezcan en todos los formularios de ticket?","errors.setup.solution":'De no ser así, consulte <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">estas instrucciones</a> y vaya a la página de administración de sus formularios de ticket para finalizar la configuración.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"El tiempo remitido es muy largo.","statuses.closed":"c","statuses.hold":"e","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"a","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"r",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutos","views.main.pause":"Detener","views.main.play":"Reproducir","views.main.reset":"Restablecer","views.main.timelogs":"Registros de tiempo","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agente","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Estado","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Tiempo","views.main.total_time_spent":"Tiempo total","views.modal.body_with_format":'La cantidad de tiempo ({{time_format}}) que se dedicó a este ticket. Edite el tiempo, si es necesario, y luego haga clic en " Enviar tiempo" .',"views.modal.close":"Cancelar","views.modal.count_down":"Esta ventana modal se cerrará automáticamente en {{time}} segundos.","views.modal.save":"Enviar tiempo","views.resume_modal.body":"¿Desea reanudar el temporizador?","views.resume_modal.no":"No","views.resume_modal.yes":"Sí","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Exportar como CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"No hay registros de tiempo para mostrar","views.timelogs.error":"No podemos cargar ningún registro de tiempo.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Ocultar registros de tiempo","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Mostrar registros de tiempo","views.timelogs.title":"Registros de tiempo"}},4922(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Getting started with the Time Tracking app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support account, then click the Admin icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps > Marketplace**, then find the Time Tracking app and click the tile.\n3. On the Time Tracking app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner. This app is only available to customers on the Professional and Enterprise plans.\n4. Enter a name for the app, select the configurations you want, then click **Install**.\n5. If you are using Ticket Forms (part of the Productivity Pack add-on), go to **Admin > Manage > Ticket Forms** and add the ticket fields 'Total time spent' and 'Time spent last update' to each of your Ticket Forms.\"","app.long_description":"* Automatically track the time spent on each of your Zendesk Support tickets\n* Customize the app to include the exact functionality that your team needs\n* Leverage Insights to create detailed reports with your time tracking data\n\nThe Time Tracking app makes managing your team's performance and overall support operations easier. Easily identify which customers send in the most complicated tickets, or which issue types take the longest for your team to resolve. Dig down into an agent's tickets to discover what's taking up their time and which issues they're experts on.\n\n### Know exactly how and where your team is spending their time\n\nKeep a running log of which support agents have worked on a ticket and how long each interaction lasted. Automatically log the total time spent the second your agent updates a ticket or let them manually enter their time.\n\n### Easy to setup, customize, and use\n\nThe Time Tracking App doesn't require any third party setup or login. Simply customize how the Time Tracking app displays and works for your support team, for a seamless fit into your team's current workflow.\n\n### Report on your time logs and take action\n\nStart reporting right away with easily built custom time tracking reports through Insights. Know exactly what's draining your support team's resources and find the best areas for optimization and improvement.\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).\"","app.name":"Time Tracking","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"The timer pauses when the agent navigates away from the ticket and resumes when the agent is back on the ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Auto pause","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blocks submission of a ticket if an agent is trying to submit a ticket with a time spent value (in seconds) greater than 1209600s (two weeks).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Debug: Block large time spent submissions","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agents can see timelog activity on tickets.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Display timelogs to agents","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"The app will not be shown to agents who do not have the 'Admin' role. This also prevents them from being able to see & edit the time upon submission.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Hide the app from agents","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agents can manually pause or reset the timer.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Display timer controls","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agents can reset the current time spent on a ticket.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Reset current time","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"When changes are made to any fields, a modal will ask if the timer should be resumed.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Resume on changes","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Prompt agents to enter a value in minutes before submitting the ticket","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Simplified time submission","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the total time.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Time Field ID","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the time spent on ticket.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Configuration Field ID","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agents can review and edit their time before submitting the ticket.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Edit time submission","app.short_description":"Helps you track time spent on tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Invalid time format, expected {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Time was negative. Resetting to 0.","errors.no_answer":"No time submitted","errors.save_hook":"You need to submit your time on this ticket.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Did you follow the installation instructions for this app and configure both required ticket fields to appear on every ticket form?","errors.setup.solution":'If not, please see <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> and go to your ticket forms management page to finalize the setup.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"The time submitted was too long.","statuses.closed":"c","statuses.hold":"h","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutes","views.main.pause":"Pause","views.main.play":"Play","views.main.reset":"Reset","views.main.timelogs":"Timelog","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Time","views.main.total_time_spent":"Total time","views.modal.body_with_format":'This is the amount of time ({{time_format}}) you spent on this ticket. Edit the time, if needed, and then click "Submit time".',"views.modal.close":"Cancel","views.modal.count_down":"This modal will automatically close in {{time}} seconds.","views.modal.save":"Submit time","views.resume_modal.body":"Would you like to resume the timer?","views.resume_modal.no":"No","views.resume_modal.yes":"Yes","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Export CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"No timelogs to display","views.timelogs.error":"We are unable to load any timelogs.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Hide timelogs","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Show timelogs","views.timelogs.title":"Timelogs"}},5365(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###Primeros pasos con la aplicación Seguimiento del tiempo:\n\n1. Inicie sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk Support y luego haga clic en el icono Administrador en la barra lateral.\n2. Seleccione **Aplicaciones > Marketplace**, busque la aplicación Seguimiento del tiempo y haga clic en el mosaico.\n3. En la página de la aplicación Seguimiento del tiempo, haga clic en **Instalar aplicación** en la esquina superior derecha. Esta aplicación está disponible solo para los clientes que tienen los planes Professional y Enterprise.\n4. Ingrese un nombre para la aplicación, seleccione la configuración que desea y luego haga clic en **Instalar**.\n5. Si usa formularios de ticket (parte del complemento Paquete de productividad), vaya a **Administrador > Administrar > Formularios de ticket** y agregue los campos de ticket Total time spent (Tiempo total transcurrido) y Time spent last update (Tiempo transcurrido última actualización) a cada uno de los formularios de ticket.","app.long_description":"* Haga un seguimiento automático del tiempo dedicado a cada ticket en su cuenta de Zendesk Support.\n* Personalice la aplicación para incluir la funcionalidad exacta que necesita su equipo\n* Aproveche Insights para crear informes detallados con los datos de seguimiento del tiempo\n\nLa aplicación Seguimiento del tiempo hace que sea fácil administrar el rendimiento de su equipo y las operaciones de soporte en general. Identifique fácilmente a los clientes que envían los tickets más complicados o los problemas que toman más tiempo en resolver. Analice los tickets de un agente para ver qué le está tomando más tiempo y en qué tipo de problemas se especializa.\n\n### Conozca exactamente cómo y en qué pasan el tiempo los integrantes de su equipo\n\nMantenga un registro de los agentes de soporte que han trabajado en un ticket y cuánto duró cada interacción. Registre automáticamente el total de tiempo transcurrido desde el mismo momento en que un agente actualiza un ticket o permítale que ingrese su tiempo manualmente.\n\n### Fácil de configurar, personalizar y usar\n\nLa aplicación Seguimiento del tiempo no requiere un inicio de sesión o una configuración de parte de terceros. Lo único que tiene que hacer es personalizar cómo se muestra y cómo funciona la aplicación Seguimiento del tiempo para su equipo de soporte, para que se adapte perfectamente al flujo de trabajo actual de su equipo.\n\n### Cree informes sobre sus registros de tiempo y tome las medidas necesarias\n\nComience a crear informes de inmediato con los informes personalizados de fácil creación para el seguimiento del tiempo mediante Insights. Sepa exactamente en qué se gastan los recursos de su equipo de soporte e identifique las áreas idóneas para realizar optimizaciones y mejoras.\n\nAl activar esta aplicación, usted acepta los [Términos de uso de Creadas por Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Seguimiento del tiempo","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"El temporizador se detiene cuando el agente abandona el ticket y vuelve a comenzar cuando regresa al ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Pausa automática","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Bloquea el envío de un ticket si un agente está intentando enviar un ticket con un valor de tiempo transcurrido (en segundos) mayor que 1209600s (dos semanas).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Depurar: bloquear envíos con mucho tiempo transcurrido","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Los agentes pueden ver la actividad del registro de tiempo en los tickets.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Mostrar registros de tiempo a los agentes","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":'Los agentes que no tengan el rol de "Administrador" no verán la aplicación. Esto también evita que puedan ver y editar el tiempo durante el envío.',"app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Ocultar la aplicación para que no la vean los agentes","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Los agentes pueden detener o restablecer manualmente el temporizador.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Mostrar controles del temporizador","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Los agentes pueden restablecer el tiempo actual dedicado al ticket.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Restablecer tiempo actual","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"Si se hacen cambios en los campos, aparecerá una ventana modal para preguntar si se desea reanudar el temporizador.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Reanudar después de cambios","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Los agentes pueden introducir un valor en minutos antes de enviar el ticket.","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Envío de tiempo simplificado","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"La ID de un campo numérico personalizado que muestra el tiempo total.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"ID de campo de tiempo","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"La ID de un campo numérico personalizado que muestra el tiempo dedicado al ticket.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"ID de campo de configuración","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Los agentes pueden revisar y editar su tiempo antes de enviar el ticket.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Editar envío de tiempo","app.short_description":"Le ayuda a llevar un registro del tiempo que se dedica a los tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Formato de hora no válido, se esperaba {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"El tiempo era negativo. Se restablecerá en 0.","errors.no_answer":"No se envió una cantidad de tiempo","