This also prevents them from being able to see & edit the time upon submission.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Hide the app from agents","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agents can manually pause or reset the timer.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Display timer controls","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agents can reset the current time spent on a ticket.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Reset current time","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"When changes are made to any fields, a modal will ask if the timer should be resumed.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Resume on changes","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Prompt agents to enter a value in minutes before submitting the ticket","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Simplified time submission","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the total time.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Time Field ID","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the time spent on ticket.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Configuration Field ID","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agents can review and edit their time before submitting the ticket.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Edit time submission","app.short_description":"Helps you track time spent on tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Invalid time format, expected {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Time was negative. Resetting to 0.","errors.no_answer":"No time submitted","errors.save_hook":"You need to submit your time on this ticket.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Did you follow the installation instructions for this app and configure both required ticket fields to appear on every ticket form?","errors.setup.solution":'If not, please see <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> and go to your ticket forms management page to finalize the setup.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"The time submitted was too long.","statuses.closed":"c","statuses.hold":"h","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutes","views.main.pause":"Pause","views.main.play":"Play","views.main.reset":"Reset","views.main.timelogs":"Timelog","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Time","views.main.total_time_spent":"Total time","views.modal.body_with_format":'This is the amount of time ({{time_format}}) you spent on this ticket. Edit the time, if needed, and then click "Submit time".',"views.modal.close":"Cancel","views.modal.count_down":"This modal will automatically close in {{time}} seconds.","views.modal.save":"Submit time","views.resume_modal.body":"Would you like to resume the timer?","views.resume_modal.no":"No","views.resume_modal.yes":"Yes","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Export CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"No timelogs to display","views.timelogs.error":"We are unable to load any timelogs.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Hide timelogs","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Show timelogs","views.timelogs.title":"Timelogs"}},6629(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Aan de slag met de app Tijdregistratie:\n\n1. Meld u aan bij uw Zendesk Support-account en klik op het pictogram Admin op de zijbalk.\n2. Selecteer **Apps > Marketplace**, zoek de app Tijdregistratie en klik op de tegel.\n3. Klik op de pagina van de app Tijdregistratie op **App installeren** rechtsboven. Deze app is alleen beschikbaar voor klanten met een Professional- of Enterprise-plan.\n4. Geef de naam voor de app op, selecteer de gewenste configuraties en klik op **Installeren**.\n5. Als u Ticketformulieren gebruikt (onderdeel van de add-on Productivity Pack), ga dan naar **Admin > Beheren > Ticketformulieren** en voeg de ticketvelden 'Total time spent' en 'Time spent last update' toe aan Ticketformulieren.","app.long_description":"* Houd automatisch de tijd bij die wordt besteed aan uw Zendesk Support-tickets\n* Pas de app aan, zodat u over de juiste functionaliteit beschikt die uw team nodig heeft\n* Maak gebruik van Insights om gedetailleerde rapporten met uw tijdregistratiegegevens te maken\n\nDe app Tijdregistratie maakt het beheren van de prestaties van uw team en het verlenen van support gemakkelijker. Identificeer eenvoudig welke klanten de meest ingewikkelde tickets sturen, of welk probleemtype uw team de meeste tijd kost. Graaf diep in de tickets van agenten om te zien wat er zo veel tijd kost en in welke problemen zij een expert zijn.\n\n### Weet precies hoe uw team zijn tijd besteedt en waaraan\n\nHoud een logbestand bij van welke supportagenten aan een ticket hebben gewerkt en hoe lang elke interactie duurde. Leg automatisch de totaal bestede tijd vast zodra een agent een ticket bijwerkt of laat agenten de tijd handmatig vastleggen.\n\n### Gemakkelijk in te stellen en te gebruiken\n\nDe app Tijdregistratie hoeft niet door derden te worden geconfigureerd en aanmelden is niet nodig. Pas eenvoudig aan hoe de app Tijdregistratie wordt weergegeven en werkt voor uw supportteam, zodat de app naadloos aansluit op de bestaande workflow van uw team.\n\n### Maak rapporten over uw tijdregistraties en onderneem waar nodig actie\n\nU kunt meteen beginnen met rapporteren in Insights dankzij ingebouwde, aangepaste tijdregistratierapporten. Weet precies wat uw supportteam veel mankracht of tijd kost en ontdek waar u kunt optimaliseren en verbeteringen kunt doorvoeren.\n\nDoor deze app in te schakelen, gaat u akkoord met de [Gebruiksvoorwaarden van Gemaakt door Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Tijdregistratie","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"De timer wordt onderbroken als de agent van het ticket weg navigeert en wordt hervat als de agent weer terug is bij het ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Automatisch onderbreken","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blokkeert verzending van een ticket als een agent een ticket probeert te verzenden met een waarde voor bestede tijd (in seconden) die groter is dan 1209600 seconden (twee weken).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Foutopsporing: Blokkeert verzending van grote waarden voor bestede tijd","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agenten kunnen de tijdlogactiviteit op de tickets zien.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Tijdlogs weergeven aan agenten","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"De app wordt niet aan agenten getoond die niet de rol Admin hebben. Hiermee wordt ook voorkomen dat ze de tijd van indiening zien en kunnen bewerken.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"De app verbergen voor agenten","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agenten kunnen de timer handmatig onderbreken en opnieuw instellen.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Bedieningselementen voor timer weergeven","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agenten kunnen de huidige tijd die aan een ticket wordt besteed opnieuw instellen.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Huidige tijd opnieuw instellen","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"Wanneer er wijzigingen worden aangebracht in velden, wordt er een dialoogvenster weergegeven waarin wordt gevraagd of de timer moet worden hervat.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Hervatten bij wijzigingen","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Agenten kunnen een waarde in minuten invoeren voordat het ticket wordt ingediend.","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Vereenvoudigde in te dienen tijd","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"De id van een aangepast numeriek veld waarin de totale tijd is vastgelegd.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Id van tijdveld","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"De id van een aangepast numeriek veld waarin de totale tijd is vastgelegd die aan een ticket is besteed.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Id van configuratieveld","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agenten kunnen hun tijd bekijken en bewerken alvorens het ticket in te dienen.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"In te dienen tijd bewerken","app.short_description":"Hiermee kunt u de tijd registreren die aan tickets wordt besteed.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Ongeldige tijdnotatie, verwacht werd {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Tijd was negatief. Wordt opnieuw ingesteld op 0.","errors.no_answer":"Geen tijd verzonden","errors.save_hook":"U dient uw tijd voor dit ticket te registreren.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Hebt u de installatie-instructies voor deze app gevolgd en beide vereiste ticketvelden geconfigureerd op elk ticketformulier?","errors.setup.solution":'Als u dat niet hebt gedaan, raadpleeg dan <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">deze instructies</a> en ga naar de beheerpagina voor ticketformulieren om de configuratie te voltooien.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"De ingediende tijd is te lang.","statuses.closed":"g","statuses.hold":"p","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"w","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minuten","views.main.pause":"Pauzeren","views.main.play":"Afspelen","views.main.reset":"Opnieuw instellen","views.main.timelogs":"Tijdlog","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Tijd","views.main.total_time_spent":"Totale tijd","views.modal.body_with_format":"Dit is de tijd ({{time_format}}) die u aan dit ticket hebt besteed. Bewerk de tijd indien nodig en klik op 'Tijd verzenden'.","views.modal.close":"Annuleren","views.modal.count_down":"Dit venster wordt over {{time}} seconden automatisch gesloten.","views.modal.save":"Tijd verzenden","views.resume_modal.body":"Wilt u de timer hervatten?","views.resume_modal.no":"Nee","views.resume_modal.yes":"Ja","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Exporteren als CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"Geen tijdlogs om weer te geven","views.timelogs.error":"Er kunnen geen tijdlogboeken worden geladen.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Tijdlogs verbergen","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Tijdlogs weergeven","views.timelogs.title":"Tijdlogs"}},4905(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Aan de slag met de app Tijdregistratie:\n\n1. Meld u aan bij uw Zendesk Support-account en klik op het pictogram Admin op de zijbalk.\n2. Selecteer **Apps > Marketplace**, zoek de app Tijdregistratie en klik op de tegel.\n3. Klik op de pagina van de app Tijdregistratie op **App installeren** rechtsboven. Deze app is alleen beschikbaar voor klanten met een Professional- of Enterprise-plan.\n4. Geef de naam voor de app op, selecteer de gewenste configuraties en klik op **Installeren**.\n5. Als u Ticketformulieren gebruikt (onderdeel van de add-on Productivity Pack), ga dan naar **Admin > Beheren > Ticketformulieren** en voeg de ticketvelden 'Total time spent' en 'Time spent last update' toe aan Ticketformulieren.","app.long_description":"* Houd automatisch de tijd bij die wordt besteed aan uw Zendesk Support-tickets\n* Pas de app aan, zodat u over de juiste functionaliteit beschikt die uw team nodig heeft\n* Maak gebruik van Insights om gedetailleerde rapporten met uw tijdregistratiegegevens te maken\n\nDe app Tijdregistratie maakt het beheren van de prestaties van uw team en het verlenen van support gemakkelijker. Identificeer eenvoudig welke klanten de meest ingewikkelde tickets sturen, of welk probleemtype uw team de meeste tijd kost. Graaf diep in de tickets van agenten om te zien wat er zo veel tijd kost en in welke problemen zij een expert zijn.\n\n### Weet precies hoe uw team zijn tijd besteedt en waaraan\n\nHoud een logbestand bij van welke supportagenten aan een ticket hebben gewerkt en hoe lang elke interactie duurde. Leg automatisch de totaal bestede tijd vast zodra een agent een ticket bijwerkt of laat agenten de tijd handmatig vastleggen.\n\n### Gemakkelijk in te stellen en te gebruiken\n\nDe app Tijdregistratie hoeft niet door derden te worden geconfigureerd en aanmelden is niet nodig. Pas eenvoudig aan hoe de app Tijdregistratie wordt weergegeven en werkt voor uw supportteam, zodat de app naadloos aansluit op de bestaande workflow van uw team.\n\n### Maak rapporten over uw tijdregistraties en onderneem waar nodig actie\n\nU kunt meteen beginnen met rapporteren in Insights dankzij ingebouwde, aangepaste tijdregistratierapporten. Weet precies wat uw supportteam veel mankracht of tijd kost en ontdek waar u kunt optimaliseren en verbeteringen kunt doorvoeren.\n\nDoor deze app in te schakelen, gaat u akkoord met de [Gebruiksvoorwaarden van Gemaakt door Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Tijdregistratie","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"De timer wordt onderbroken als de agent van het ticket weg navigeert en wordt hervat als de agent weer terug is bij het ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Automatisch onderbreken","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blokkeert verzending van een ticket als een agent een ticket probeert te verzenden met een waarde voor bestede tijd (in seconden) die groter is dan 1209600 seconden (twee weken).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Foutopsporing: Blokkeert verzending van grote waarden voor bestede tijd","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agenten kunnen de tijdlogactiviteit op de tickets zien.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Tijdlogs weergeven aan agenten","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"De app wordt niet aan agenten getoond die niet de rol Admin hebben. Hiermee wordt ook voorkomen dat ze de tijd van indiening zien en kunnen bewerken.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"De app verbergen voor agenten","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agenten kunnen de timer handmatig onderbreken en opnieuw instellen.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Bedieningselementen voor timer weergeven","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agenten kunnen de huidige tijd die aan een ticket wordt besteed opnieuw instellen.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Huidige tijd opnieuw instellen","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"Wanneer er wijzigingen worden aangebracht in velden, wordt er een dialoogvenster weergegeven waarin wordt gevraagd of de timer moet worden hervat.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Hervatten bij wijzigingen","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Agenten kunnen een waarde in minuten invoeren voordat het ticket wordt ingediend.","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Vereenvoudigde in te dienen tijd","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"De id van een aangepast numeriek veld waarin de totale tijd is vastgelegd.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Id van tijdveld","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"De id van een aangepast numeriek veld waarin de totale tijd is vastgelegd die aan een ticket is besteed.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Id van configuratieveld","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agenten kunnen hun tijd bekijken en bewerken alvorens het ticket in te dienen.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"In te dienen tijd bewerken","app.short_description":"Hiermee kunt u de tijd registreren die aan tickets wordt besteed.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Ongeldige tijdnotatie, verwacht werd {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Tijd was negatief. Wordt opnieuw ingesteld op 0.","errors.no_answer":"Geen tijd verzonden","errors.save_hook":"U dient uw tijd voor dit ticket te registreren.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Hebt u de installatie-instructies voor deze app gevolgd en beide vereiste ticketvelden geconfigureerd op elk ticketformulier?","errors.setup.solution":'Als u dat niet hebt gedaan, raadpleeg dan <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">deze instructies</a> en ga naar de beheerpagina voor ticketformulieren om de configuratie te voltooien.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"De ingediende tijd is te lang.","statuses.closed":"g","statuses.hold":"p","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"w","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minuten","views.main.pause":"Pauzeren","views.main.play":"Afspelen","views.main.reset":"Opnieuw instellen","views.main.timelogs":"Tijdlog","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Tijd","views.main.total_time_spent":"Totale tijd","views.modal.body_with_format":"Dit is de tijd ({{time_format}}) die u aan dit ticket hebt besteed. Bewerk de tijd indien nodig en klik op 'Tijd verzenden'.","views.modal.close":"Annuleren","views.modal.count_down":"Dit venster wordt over {{time}} seconden automatisch gesloten.","views.modal.save":"Tijd verzenden","views.resume_modal.body":"Wilt u de timer hervatten?","views.resume_modal.no":"Nee","views.resume_modal.yes":"Ja","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Exporteren als CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"Geen tijdlogs om weer te geven","views.timelogs.error":"Er kunnen geen tijdlogboeken worden geladen.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Tijdlogs verbergen","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Tijdlogs weergeven","views.timelogs.title":"Tijdlogs"}},476(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Innføring i appen Tidssporing:\n\n1. Logg deg inn på Zendesk Support-kontoen og klikk på Admin-ikonet i sidefeltet.\n2. Velg **Apper > Markedsplass**, finn appen Tidssporing og klikk på flisen.\n3. Klikk **Installer app** oppe til høyre på siden for Tidssporing-appen. Denne appen er kun tilgjengelig for kunder med Professional- eller Enterprise-abonnement.\n4. Legg inn et navn for appen og konfigurer innstillingene, og velg deretter **Installer**.\n5. Hvis du bruker Saksskjema (som er en del av tilleggsprogrammet produktivitetspakke), går du til **Admin > Administrer > Saksskjema og legger til saksfeltet «Total time spent» (anvendt tid totalt) og «Time spent last update» (anvendt tid siden siste oppdatering) til hvert enkelt saksskjema.","app.long_description":"* Hold automatisk rede på tiden som ble brukt på hver Zendesk Support-sak\n* Tilpass appen slik at den omfatter nøyaktig den funksjonaliteten som teamet trenger\n* Benytt deg av Insights til å opprette detaljerte rapporter med tidssporingsdataene \n\nTidssporing-appen gjør det enklere å styre teamets fremdrift og generell kundestøttefunksjon. Du kan lett finne de kundene som sender inn de mest kompliserte sakene, eller hvilken problemtype det tar lengst tid for teamet å løse. Utforsk sakene til kundekonsulentene for å finne ut hva som tar mest tid og hvilke problemer de er eksperter på.\n\n### Vær informert om nøyaktig hvor og hvordan teamet benytter tiden\n\nFør en løpende logg over kundekonsulenter som har jobbet med en sak, og hvor lang tid hver interaksjon varte. Registrer total tid automatisk idet kundekonsulenten oppdaterer en sak , eller la dem legge inn tiden manuelt.\n\n### Enkel å konfigurere, tilpasse og bruke\n\nAppen Tidssporing trenger ikke noen konfigurering eller pålogging av tredjepart. Du kan simpelthen tilpasse hvordan appen Tidssporing vises og fungerer for kundestøtteteamet, slik at den sømløst passer inn i teamets aktuelle arbeidsflyt.\n\n### Lag rapporter basert på tidsloggene, og sett i verk tiltak\n\nKom i gang med rapporter med én gang med spesialtilpassede tidsloggrapporter som er lette å lage med Insights. Hold rede på hva det er som tapper kundestøtteteamets ressurser, og finn de beste mulighetene for optimalisering og forbedring.\n\nVed å aktivere denne appen godtar du [Laget av Zendesk-brukervilkårene](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Tidssporing","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"Tidtakeren tar pause når kundekonsulenten går bort fra saken og starter igjen når kundekonsulenten kommer tilbake til saken.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Auto-stans","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blokkerer innsending av en sak hvis kundekonsulenten prøver å sende inn en sak med en verdi for anvendt tid (i sekunder) større enn 1209600 s (to uker).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Feilsøk: Blokker innsending med mye anvendt tid","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Kundekonsulentene kan se aktivitet i tidsloggen for sakene.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Vis tidslogg til kundekonsulentene","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"Appen vil ikke bli vist til kundekonsulenter som ikke har rollen «Admin». De kan heller ikke se og redigere tiden før saken sendes inn.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Skjul appen fra kundekonsulentene","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Kundekonsulentene kan manuelt stanse eller tilbakestille tidtakeren.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Vis tidtakerkontroller","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Kundekonsulentene kan tilbakestille tiden som til nå er brukt på saken.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Tilbakestill gjeldende tid","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"Når det foretas endringer i felt, vil en sperredialog spørre om tidtakeren skal startes igjen.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Start igjen ved endringer","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Kundekonsulenter kan legge inn hvor mange minutter de har brukt før de sender inn en sak.","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Forenklet tidsinnsending","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"IDen til et tilpasset tallfelt som inneholder sammenlagt tid.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Tidsfelt-ID","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"IDen til et tilpasset tallfelt som inneholder tiden som ble brukt på saken.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Konfigurasjonsfelt-ID","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Kundekonsulentene kan se gjennom og korrigere tiden før saken sendes inn.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Rediger tiden som sendes inn","app.short_description":"Holder rede på hvor mye tid som brukes på sakene.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Ugyldig tidsformat, forventet {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Tiden var negativ. Tilbakestiller til 0.","errors.no_answer":"Ingen tid ble sendt inn","errors.save_hook":"Du må sende inn tiden brukt på denne saken.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Fulgte du installasjonsveiledningen for denne appen og konfigurerte den slik at begge de obligatoriske saksfeltene vises på alle saksskjema?","errors.setup.solution":'Hvis ikke, kan du lese <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">disse instruksjonene</a> og gå til siden for saksskjemabehandling for å konfigurere ferdig.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"Tiden som ble lagt inn, var for lang.","statuses.closed":"a","statuses.hold":"p","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"å","statuses.pending":"v","statuses.solved":"l",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutter","views.main.pause":"Stans","views.main.play":"Kjør","views.main.reset":"Tilbakestill","views.main.timelogs":"Tidslogger","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Kundekonsulent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Tid","views.main.total_time_spent":"Sammenlagt tid","views.modal.body_with_format":"Dette viser hvor mye tid ({{time_format}}) du har brukt på denne saken. Rediger tiden, om nødvendig, og klikk på «Send inn tiden».","views.modal.close":"Avbryt","views.modal.count_down":"Denne sperredialogen lukkes automatisk etter {{time}} sekunder.","views.modal.save":"Send inn tiden","views.resume_modal.body":"Vil du starte tidtakeren igjen?","views.resume_modal.no":"Nei","views.resume_modal.yes":"Ja","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Eksporter CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"Ingen tidslogger å vise","views.timelogs.error":"Kan ikke laste inn noen tidslogger.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Skjul tidslogger","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Vis tidslogger","views.timelogs.title":"Tidslogger"}},7627(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Wprowadzenie do aplikacji Monitorowanie czasu:\n\n1. Zaloguj się na koncie Zendesk Support i kliknij ikonę Administracja w menu bocznym.\n2. Wybierz **Aplikacje > Marketplace**, znajdź aplikację Monitorowanie czasu i kliknij kafelek.\n3. Na stronie aplikacji Monitorowanie czasu kliknij przycisk **Zainstaluj aplikację** widoczny w prawym górnym rogu. Ta aplikacja jest dostępna tylko dla klientów korzystających z planów Plus i Enterprise.\n4. Wprowadź nazwę aplikacji, wybierz konfigurację i kliknij **Zainstaluj**.\n5. Jeśli korzystasz z funkcji Formularze zgłoszeń (składnika dodatku Pakiet wydajnościowy), przejdź do sekcji **Administracja > Zarządzaj > Formularze zgłoszeń** i do każdego formularza zgłoszenia dodaj pola zgłoszenia „Total time spent” (Poświęcony czas łącznie) oraz „Time spent last update” (Czas poświęcony na ostatnią aktualizację).","app.long_description":"* Automatycznie monitoruj czas poświęcony na poszczególne zgłoszenia w Zendesk Support\n* Dostosuj aplikację, dodając dokładnie te funkcje, których potrzebuje Twój zespół\n* Twórz szczegółowe raporty z danych monitorowania czasu za pomocą aplikacji Insights\n\nAplikacja Monitorowanie czasu ułatwia zarządzanie wydajnością zespołu i ogólną wydajnością operacji wsparcia. Możesz łatwo identyfikować klientów, którzy wysyłają najtrudniejsze zgłoszenia lub których problemy zajmują zespołowi najwięcej czasu. Możesz też analizować zgłoszenia agenta, aby ustalić, co zabiera mu czas i w jakich problemach się specjalizuje.\n\n### Zdobywaj dokładne informacje o tym, jak i gdzie zespół spędza czas\n\nProwadź na bieżąco rejestr agentów wsparcia pracujących nad zgłoszeniem oraz czasów trwania poszczególnych interakcji. Możesz włączyć automatyczne rejestrowanie łącznego czasu poświęconego na zgłoszenie w chwili aktualizacji zgłoszenia przez agenta lub zezwolić na ręczne podawanie czasu.\n\n### Łatwość konfiguracji, dostosowywania oraz obsługi\n\nAplikacja Monitorowanie czasu nie wymaga żadnej konfiguracji ani loginu z zewnątrz. Aby bezproblemowo dopasowała się do aktualnej organizacji pracy zespołu wsparcia, wystarczy dostosować sposób jej wyświetlania i działania pod kątem zespołu.\n\n### Sporządzaj raporty z rejestrów czasu i działaj na ich podstawie\n\nDzięki łatwemu tworzeniu dostosowanych raportów z monitorowania czasu w aplikacji Insights możesz niezwłocznie zacząć korzystać z zalet raportowania. Będziesz dokładnie wiedzieć, co zajmuje zasoby zespołu wsparcia, i wykryjesz obszary wymagające optymalizacji oraz udoskonaleń.\n\nWłączając tę aplikację, wyrażasz zgodę na [Warunki użytkowania dotyczące aplikacji opracowanej przez Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Monitorowanie czasu","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"Licznik jest wstrzymywany, gdy agent odchodzi od zgłoszenia, i wznawiany, gdy agent wraca do zgłoszenia.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Automatyczne wstrzymanie","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Umożliwia zablokowanie wysłania zgłoszenia, jeśli agent próbuje to zrobić, gdy wartość poświęconego czasu (w sekundach) jest większa niż 1209600 s (dwa tygodnie).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Debuguj: blokuj wysyłanie przy dużych wartościach poświęconego czasu","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Rejestry czasu obsługi zgłoszeń są widoczne dla agentów.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Pokaż rejestry czasu agentom","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"Ta aplikacja nie będzie widoczna dla agentów, którzy nie mają roli Administrator. Nie będą oni też mogli zobaczyć ani edytować czasu przy wysyłaniu.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Ukryj aplikację przed agentami","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agenci mogą ręcznie wstrzymywać lub resetować licznik.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Pokaż elementy sterujące licznikiem","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agenci mogą resetować bieżący czas poświęcony na zgłoszenie.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Resetuj bieżący czas","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"W razie wprowadzenia zmian w którychkolwiek polach pojawi się okno z pytaniem, czy ma zostać wznowione działanie licznika czasu.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Wznów przy zmianach","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Przed wysłaniem zgłoszenia agenci mogą podać wartość w minutach.","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Uproszczone wysyłanie czasu","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"ID dostosowanego pola numerycznego, w którym będzie przechowywany czas całkowity.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"ID pola czasu","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"ID dostosowanego pola numerycznego, w którym będzie przechowywany czas poświęcony na zgłoszenie.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"ID pola konfiguracji","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agenci mogą przeglądać i edytować swój czas przed wysłaniem zgłoszenia.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Edytuj wysyłany czas","app.short_description":"Ułatwia monitorowanie czasu poświęcanego na obsługę zgłoszeń.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Nieprawidłowy format godziny. Oczekiwano: {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Czas był ujemny. Zostanie zresetowany do wartości 0.","errors.no_answer":"Nie wysłano czasu","errors.save_hook":"Musisz wysłać informacje o czasie poświęconym na to zgłoszenie.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Czy w przypadku tej aplikacji postąpiono zgodnie z instrukcjami instalacji i skonfigurowano oba wymagane pola zgłoszenia do wyświetlania w każdym formularzu zgłoszenia?","errors.setup.solution":'Jeśli nie, zapoznaj się z <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">instrukcjami</a> i przejdź do strony zarządzania formularzami zgłoszeń, aby ukończyć konfigurację.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"Wysłany czas jest zbyt długi.","statuses.closed":"m","statuses.hold":"w","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"p","statuses.pending":"o","statuses.solved":"z",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"min","views.main.pause":"Wstrzymaj","views.main.play":"Uruchom","views.main.reset":"Resetuj","views.main.timelogs":"Rejestr czasu","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Godzina","views.main.total_time_spent":"Czas całkowity","views.modal.body_with_format":"To jest ilość czasu ({{time_format}}) poświęconego na zgłoszenie. W razie potrzeby edytuj czas i kliknij „Wyślij czas”.","views.modal.close":"Anuluj","views.modal.count_down":"To okno zostanie automatycznie zamknięte za {{time}} s.","views.modal.save":"Wyślij czas","views.resume_modal.body":"Chcesz wznowić działanie licznika czasu?","views.resume_modal.no":"Nie","views.resume_modal.yes":"Tak","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Eksportuj jako CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"Brak rejestrów czasu do wyświetlenia","views.timelogs.error":"Nie można załadować żadnych rejestrów czasu.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Ukryj rejestr czasu","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Pokaż rejestr czasu","views.timelogs.title":"Rejestr czasu"}},3162(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Introdução ao aplicativo Controle de horas:\n\n1. Entre em sua conta do Zendesk Support e, em seguida, clique no ícone Admin. na barra lateral.\n2. Selecione **Aplicativos > Marketplace**, encontre o aplicativo Controle de horas e clique no ícone.\n3. Na página do aplicativo Controle de horas, clique em **Instalar aplicativo** no canto superior direito. O aplicativo está disponível apenas para clientes nos planos Professional e Enterprise.\n4. Insira um nome para o aplicativo, selecione as configurações desejadas e clique em **Instalar**.\n5. Se você estiver usando os Formulários de ticket (parte do complemento Pacote de produtividade), visite **Admin. > Gerenciar > Formulários de ticket** e adicione os campos de ticket “Total time spent” e “Time spent last update” a cada formulário de ticket.","app.long_description":"* Acompanhe automaticamente o tempo gasto em cada ticket do Zendesk Support\n* Personalize o aplicativo para incluir o recurso exato que sua equipe precisa\n* Aproveite o Insights para criar relatórios detalhados com dados de controle de horas\n\nO aplicativo Controle de horas facilita a gestão do desempenho da sua equipe e as operações de suporte em geral. Identifique facilmente quais clientes enviam os tickets mais complicados ou quais tipos de problema exigem mais tempo da sua equipe para a resolução. Se aprofunde nos tickets de um agente para descobrir o que está consumindo o tempo dele e os tipos de problemas nos quais ele é especialista.\n\n### Saiba exatamente como e onde sua equipe está gastando o tempo dela\n\nMantenha um registro corrente de quais agentes de suporte trabalharam em um ticket e da duração de cada interação. Registre automaticamente o tempo total gasto desde a primeira atualização do ticket por seu agente ou permita que ele insira o horário.\n\n### Fácil de configurar, personalizar e usar\n\nO aplicativo Controle de horas não requer configuração ou acesso de terceiros. Personalize como o aplicativo Controle de horas será exibido e funcionará para sua equipe de suporte, de modo que ele se encaixe otimizadamente no fluxo de trabalho atual da sua equipe.\n\n### Crie relatórios dos registros de tempo e aja\n\nComece suas análises agora com relatórios personalizados de controle de horas que podem ser facilmente criados com o Insights. Saiba exatamente o que está sugando os recursos da sua equipe de suporte e encontre as áreas que precisam de otimização e melhoria.\n\nAtivando esse aplicativo, Você concorda com os [Termos de Uso do Built by Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Controle de horas","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"O cronômetro para quando um agente sai do ticket e retoma sua contagem quando ele volta ao ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Pausa automática","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Impede o envio de um ticket se um agente estiver tentando enviar um ticket com um valor de tempo gasto (em segundos) maior que 1.209.600 segundos (duas semanas).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Depuração: impedir o envio de tickets muito antigos","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Os agentes podem ver a atividade de registro de tempo em tickets.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Exibir registros de tempo para os agentes","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"O aplicativo não será exibido para agentes sem a função de Administrador. Isso também não permite que eles vejam e editem a hora no momento do envio.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Ocultar esse aplicativo dos agentes","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Os agentes podem pausar ou redefinir manualmente o cronômetro.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Exibir controles do cronômetro","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Os agentes podem redefinir o tempo gasto atualmente em um ticket.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Redefinir tempo atual","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"Quando forem feitas alterações em qualquer campo, uma caixa de diálogo modal perguntará se o cronômetro deve ser reiniciado.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Continuar em caso de alterações","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Os agentes podem inserir um valor em minutos antes de enviar o ticket.","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Envio simplificado de tempo","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"A ID de um campo numérico personalizado que contará o tempo total.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"ID do campo de tempo","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"A ID de um campo numérico personalizado que contará o tempo gasto em um ticket.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"ID do campo de configuração","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Os agentes podem consultar e editar o tempo deles antes de enviarem o ticket.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Editar envio de tempo","app.short_description":"Ajuda a monitorar o tempo gasto em tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Formato de hora inválido; {{time_format}} é esperado.","errors.negative_time":"Tempo negativo. Redefinindo para 0.","errors.no_answer":"Nenhum tempo enviado","errors.save_hook":"Você precisa enviar seu tempo neste ticket.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Você seguiu as instruções de instalação para esse aplicativo e configurou os dois campos de ticket obrigatórios a serem exibidos em todos os formulários de ticket?","errors.setup.solution":'Se não, consulte <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">essas instruções</a> e vá para a página de gerenciamento de formulários de ticket para finalizar a configuração.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"O tempo enviado é muito longo.","statuses.closed":"f","statuses.hold":"e","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"a","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"r",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutos","views.main.pause":"Pausar","views.main.play":"Iniciar","views.main.reset":"Redefinir","views.main.timelogs":"Registro de tempo","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agente","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Tempo","views.main.total_time_spent":"Tempo total","views.modal.body_with_format":'Esse é o tempo ({{time_format}}) gasto no ticket. Se necessário, edite o tempo e clique em " Enviar tempo" .',"views.modal.close":"Cancelar","views.modal.count_down":"Esta janela fechará automaticamente em {{time}} segundos.","views.modal.save":"Enviar tempo","views.resume_modal.body":"Gostaria de reiniciar o cronômetro?","views.resume_modal.no":"Não","views.resume_modal.yes":"Sim","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Exportar CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"Sem registros de tempo para exibir","views.timelogs.error":"Não foi possível carregar os registros de tempo.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Ocultar registros de tempo","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Exibir registros de tempo","views.timelogs.title":"Registros de tempo"}},6147(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Introdução ao aplicativo Controle de horas:\n\n1. Entre em sua conta do Zendesk Support e, em seguida, clique no ícone Admin. na barra lateral.\n2. Selecione **Aplicativos > Marketplace**, encontre o aplicativo Controle de horas e clique no ícone.\n3. Na página do aplicativo Controle de horas, clique em **Instalar aplicativo** no canto superior direito. O aplicativo está disponível apenas para clientes nos planos Professional e Enterprise.\n4. Insira um nome para o aplicativo, selecione as configurações desejadas e clique em **Instalar**.\n5. Se você estiver usando os Formulários de ticket (parte do complemento Pacote de produtividade), visite **Admin. > Gerenciar > Formulários de ticket** e adicione os campos de ticket “Total time spent” e “Time spent last update” a cada formulário de ticket.","app.long_description":"* Acompanhe automaticamente o tempo gasto em cada ticket do Zendesk Support\n* Personalize o aplicativo para incluir o recurso exato que sua equipe precisa\n* Aproveite o Insights para criar relatórios detalhados com dados de controle de horas\n\nO aplicativo Controle de horas facilita a gestão do desempenho da sua equipe e as operações de suporte em geral. Identifique facilmente quais clientes enviam os tickets mais complicados ou quais tipos de problema exigem mais tempo da sua equipe para a resolução. Se aprofunde nos tickets de um agente para descobrir o que está consumindo o tempo dele e os tipos de problemas nos quais ele é especialista.\n\n### Saiba exatamente como e onde sua equipe está gastando o tempo dela\n\nMantenha um registro corrente de quais agentes de suporte trabalharam em um ticket e da duração de cada interação. Registre automaticamente o tempo total gasto desde a primeira atualização do ticket por seu agente ou permita que ele insira o horário.\n\n### Fácil de configurar, personalizar e usar\n\nO aplicativo Controle de horas não requer configuração ou acesso de terceiros. Personalize como o aplicativo Controle de horas será exibido e funcionará para sua equipe de suporte, de modo que ele se encaixe otimizadamente no fluxo de trabalho atual da sua equipe.\n\n### Crie relatórios dos registros de tempo e aja\n\nComece suas análises agora com relatórios personalizados de controle de horas que podem ser facilmente criados com o Insights. Saiba exatamente o que está sugando os recursos da sua equipe de suporte e encontre as áreas que precisam de otimização e melhoria.\n\nAtivando esse aplicativo, Você concorda com os [Termos de Uso do Built by Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Acompanhamento do Tempo","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"O temporizador pausa quando o agente se afasta do ticket e retoma quando o agente volta ao ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Pausa automática","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Bloqueia o envio de um ticket se um agente estiver a tentar submeter um ticket com um valor de tempo gasto (em segundos) superior a 1209600s (duas semanas).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Depuração: Bloqueia o tempo gasto nas submissões","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Os agentes podem ver a atividade do registo de tempo nos tickets.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Mostrar os registos de tempo aos agentes","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"A aplicação não será mostrada a agentes que não tenham a função de 'Administrador'. Isto também impede que possam ver e editar o tempo no momento da submissão.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Esconda a aplicação dos agentes","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Os agentes podem pausar ou reiniciar manualmente o temporizador.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Controlo do temporizador de ecrã","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Os agentes podem repor o tempo atual gasto num ticket.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Reiniciar o tempo atual","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"Quando são feitas alterações a qualquer campo, um modal pergunta se o temporizador deve ser retomado.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Resumo das alterações","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Solicite aos agentes que introduzam um valor em minutos antes de submeterem o ticket","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Submissão em tempo simplificado","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"O ID de um campo numérico personalizado que contém o tempo total.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"ID de campo temporal","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"O ID de um campo numérico personalizado que contém o tempo gasto no ticket.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"ID do campo de configuração","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Os agentes podem rever e editar o seu tempo antes de submeter o pedido.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Submissão por tempo de edição","app.short_description":"Ajuda a monitorizar o tempo gasto em tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Formato de hora inválido, esperado {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"O tempo era negativo. Reiniciando para 0.","errors.no_answer":"Sem tempo submetido","errors.save_hook":"Tens de submeter o teu tempo neste ticket.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Seguiste as instruções de instalação desta aplicação e configuraste ambos os campos de tickets obrigatórios para aparecerem em todos os formulários de ticket?","errors.setup.solution":'Se não, por favor consulte <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">Estas instruções</a> E vai à página de gestão dos formulários de tickets para finalizar a configuração.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"O tempo de submissão foi demasiado longo.","statuses.closed":"c","statuses.hold":"h","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"Ata","views.main.pause":"Pausa","views.main.play":"Jogo","views.main.reset":"Reiniciar","views.main.timelogs":"Registo de Tempo","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agente","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Estado","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Hora","views.main.total_time_spent":"Tempo total","views.modal.body_with_format":'Este é o tempo que demora ({{time_format}}) gastaste neste ticket. Edita a hora, se necessário, e depois clica em "Enviar tempo".',"views.modal.close":"Cancelar","views.modal.count_down":"Este modal fecha-se automaticamente {{time}} segundos.","views.modal.save":"Tempo de submissão","views.resume_modal.body":"Queres retomar o temporizador?","views.resume_modal.no":"Não","views.resume_modal.yes":"Sim","views.timelogs.csv_export":"CSV de exportação","views.timelogs.empty":"Sem registos de tempo para mostrar","views.timelogs.error":"Não conseguimos carregar quaisquer registos de tempo.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Ocultar registos de tempo","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Registos horários do programa","views.timelogs.title":"Registos de tempo"}},5696(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Ghid introductiv pentru aplicația Cronometru:\r\n\r\n1. Autentificați-vă în contul Zendesk Support, apoi faceți clic pe pictograma Administrator din bara laterală.\r\n2. Selectați **Aplicații > Magazin**, apoi găsiți aplicația Cronometru și faceți clic pe dală.\r\n3. În pagina aplicației Cronometru, faceți clic pe **Instalare aplicație** în colțul din dreapta-sus. Această aplicație este disponibilă numai clienților care utilizează abonamentele Professional și Enterprise.\r\n4. Introduceți un nume pentru aplicație, selectați configurațiile dorite, apoi faceți clic pe **Instalare**.\r\n5. Dacă utilizați Formulare pentru tichete (parte din programul de completare Productivity Pack), mergeți la **Administrator > Gestionare > Formulare pentru tichete** și adăugați câmpurile pentru tichete „Total time spent” și „Time spent last update” în fiecare dintre formularele pentru tichete.","app.long_description":"* Urmăriți automat timpul petrecut cu fiecare dintre tichetele dumneavoastră Zendesk Support\n* Personalizați aplicația pentru a include funcționalitatea exactă de care are nevoie echipa dumneavoastră\n* Folosiți Insights pentru a crea rapoarte detaliate cu datele cronometrului\n\n Aplicația Cronometru facilitează gestionarea performanțelor echipei dumneavoastră și ale operațiunilor de asistență globale. Identificați cu ușurință clienții care trimit cele mai complicate tichete sau tipurile de probleme a căror rezolvare de către echipa dumneavoastră durează cel mai mult. Explorați tichetele unui agent pentru a descoperi ce îi consumă mai mult timp și în ce probleme este expert.\n\n### Știți cu exactitate cum și pentru ce își petrece timpul echipa dumneavoastră\n\nPăstrați o evidență dinamică a agenților de asistență care au lucrat la un tichet și a duratei fiecărei interacțiuni. Înregistrați automat timpul total petrecut exact din momentul în care agentul actualizează un tichet sau permiteți agenților să își introducă manual timpul.\n\n### Ușor de configurat, de personalizat și de utilizat\n\n Aplicația Cronometru nu necesită nicio terță configurare sau autentificare. Pur și simplu personalizați modul în care aplicația Cronometru se afișează și funcționează pentru echipa dumneavoastră de asistență, pentru o potrivire perfectă cu fluxul de lucru curent al echipei dumneavoastră.\n\n### Obțineți rapoarte cu privire la desfășurătoare și luați măsuri\n\nÎncepeți raportarea imediat, cu rapoarte de cronometrare ușor de creat și de personalizat, prin intermediul Insights. Știți cu exactitate ce chestiuni epuizează resursele echipei dumneavoastră de asistență și găsiți cele mai potrivite arii de optimizare și îmbunătățire.\n\nActivând această aplicație, sunteți de acord cu [Termenii de utilizare pentru produsele desemnate prin „Conceput de Zendesk”] (https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Cronometru","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"Cronometrul este pus pe pauză atunci când agentul părăsește tichetul și este repornit atunci când agentul revine la tichet.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Punere automată pe pauză","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blochează trimiterea unui tichet dacă un agent încearcă să trimită un tichet cu valoarea timpului petrecut (în secunde) mai mare decât 1209600s (două săptămâni).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Depanare: Blocați trimiterile cu timp petrecut mare","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agenții pot vedea activitățile desfășurătorului în tichete.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Afișare desfășurătoare pentru agenți","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"Aplicația nu va fi afișată agenților care nu dețin rolul „Administrator”. Aceasta previne, de asemenea, posibilitatea ca aceștia să poată vedea și edita ora în momentul trimiterii tichetelor.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Ascundere aplicație față de agenți","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agenții pot să pună manual pe pauză sau să reseteze manual cronometrul.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Afișare controale cronometru","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agenții pot să reseteze timpul curent petrecut cu un tichet.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Resetare timp curent","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"Când se efectuează modificări în orice câmpuri, o casetă de dialog vă va întreba dacă doriți să reporniți cronometrul.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Repornire la modificări","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Se solicită agenților să introducă o valoare exprimată în minute înainte de a trimite tichetul","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Trimitere simplificată a timpului","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"Identificatorul unui câmp numeric personalizat care va conține timpul total.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Identificator câmp timp","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"Identificatorul unui câmp numeric personalizat care va conține timpul petrecut cu un tichet.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Identificator câmp configurație","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agenții pot să își revizuiască și să își editeze timpul înainte de a trimite tichetul.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Editare a timpului trimis","app.short_description":"Vă ajută să urmăriți timpul petrecut cu tichetele.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Format orar nevalid, se așteaptă {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Durata este negativă. Se resetează la 0.","errors.no_answer":"Nu s-a trimis un timp","errors.save_hook":"Trebuie să vă trimiteți timpul petrecut cu acest tichet.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Ați urmat instrucțiunile de instalare pentru această aplicație și ați configurat ambele câmpuri obligatorii pentru tichet astfel încât să apară pe fiecare formular pentru tichete?","errors.setup.solution":'Dacă nu, vă rugăm să consultați <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">aceste instrucțiuni</a> și să mergeți la pagina de gestionare a formularelor pentru tichete pentru a finaliza configurarea.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"Durata introdusă a fost prea lungă.","statuses.closed":"î","statuses.hold":"p","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"d","statuses.pending":"a","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minute","views.main.pause":"Pauză","views.main.play":"Redare","views.main.reset":"Resetare","views.main.timelogs":"Desfășurător","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Stare","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Oră","views.main.total_time_spent":"Timp total","views.modal.body_with_format":"Acesta este durata de timp ({{time_format}}) petrecută de dumneavoastră cu acest tichet. Editați timpul, dacă este nevoie, apoi faceți clic pe „Trimitere timp”.","views.modal.close":"Anulare","views.modal.count_down":"Această casetă modală se va închide automat în {{time}} secunde.","views.modal.save":"Trimitere timp","views.resume_modal.body":"Doriți să reporniți cronometrul?","views.resume_modal.no":"Nu","views.resume_modal.yes":"Da","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Export CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"Nu există desfășurătoare de afișat","views.timelogs.error":"Nu am putut încărca niciun desfășurător.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Ascundere desfășurătoare","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Afișare desfășurătoare","views.timelogs.title":"Desfășurătoare"}},442(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Основы работы с приложением «Учет времени»:\n\n1. Войдите в аккаунт Zendesk Support и щелкните значок «Администратор» на боковой панели.\n2. Выберите команды **Приложения > Marketplace**, затем найдите приложение «Учет времени» и щелкните его плитку.\n3. На странице приложения щелкните ссылку **Установить приложение** в верхнем правом углу. Это приложение доступно только пользователям тарифных пакетов Professional и Enterprise.\n4. Введите название приложения и задайте настройки, затем нажмите кнопку **Установить**.\n5. Если вы используете формы тикетов (из дополнения Productivity Pack), выберите меню **Администратор > Управление > Формы тикетов** и добавьте поля тикетов «Total time spent (Общее затраченное время)» и «Time spent last update (Длительность последнего обновления)» в каждую форму тикетов.","app.long_description":"* Автоматический учет времени, затраченного на каждый из тикетов Zendesk Support\n* Настройте в приложении использование именно тех функций, которые нужны вашей службе\n* Используйте Insights для составления подробных отчетов с данными учета времени\n\nПриложение «Учет времени» облегчает контроль производительности вашего коллектива и управление услугами поддержки в целом. С его помощью можно определить, какие клиенты отправляют самые трудные тикеты или проблемы каких типов отнимают у ваших сотрудников больше всего времени. Узнайте, на что уходит время ваших агентов и в решении каких проблем они достигли совершенства.\n\n### Получите точную информацию о том, как и где расходуется рабочее время ваших сотрудников\n\nВедите журнал работы агентов поддержки, которые занимались данным тикетом, и записывайте, как долго проводилась каждая операция. Общее затраченное время автоматически регистрируется в ту же секунду, когда агент обновляет тикет. Также агент может задать это время вручную.\n\n### Удобство в установке, настройке и использовании\n\nПриложение «Учет времени» не требует установки каких-либо сторонних программ или входа в какой-либо сторонний сервис. Просто укажите, как должно отображаться и работать приложение «Учет времени», чтобы оно идеально вписалось в существующий рабочий процесс вашей службы поддержки.\n\n### Составьте отчет по использованию времени и примите соответствующие меры\n\nПриложение Insights позволяет с удобством создавать специализированные отчеты о затраченном времени. Из них вы точно узнаете, на что расходуются ресурсы вашей службы поддержки и где есть потенциал для оптимизации и совершенствования.\n\nАктивируя это приложение, вы принимаете [Условия пользования продуктами Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Учет времени","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"Таймер останавливается, когда агент уходит от тикета, и возобновляет отсчет времени, когда агент возвращается к тикету.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Автопауза","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Блокировать отправку тикета, если агент потратил на это более 1209600 с (двух недель).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Отладка: блокировать тикеты, на отправку которых затрачено много времени","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Агенты могут следить за ходом действий с тикетами.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Показывать журналы агентам","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"Приложение не будет доступно для агентов, которые не имеют роли «Администратор». Кроме того, они не смогут узнавать и изменять время до отправки тикета.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Скрыть приложение от агентов","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Агенты могут вручную останавливать или сбрасывать таймер.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Показывать органы управления таймеров","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Агенты могут обнулить текущее время, затраченное на работу с тикетом.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Обнулить текущее время","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"При внесении изменений в любые поля появляется окно с предложением запустить таймер снова.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Продолжить с изменениями","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Предлагать агентам ввести значение в минутах до отправки тикета.","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Упрощенное указание времени","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"ID специального числового поля, в котором записано полное время.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"ID поля времени","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"ID специального числового поля, в котором записано время, затраченное на работу с тикетом.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"ID поля настройки","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Агенты могут просматривать и редактировать сведения о затраченном времени перед отправкой тикета.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Редактировать время","app.short_description":"Помогает контролировать время, затраченное на работу с тикетами.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Неправильный формат времени, ожидалось {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Отрицательное время. Изменено на 0.","errors.no_answer":"Время не зафиксировано","errors.save_hook":"Вы должны сообщить время, затраченное на этот тикет.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Вы выполнили инструкции по установке этого приложения и настроили отображение обоих обязательных полей тикета в каждой форме тикета?","errors.setup.solution":'Если нет, обратитесь к <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">этим инструкциям</a> и перейдите на страницу управления формами тикетов для завершения настройки.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"Указано слишком длительное время.","statuses.closed":"з","statuses.hold":"у","statuses.new":"н","statuses.open":"о","statuses.pending":"ж","statuses.solved":"в",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"мин.","views.main.pause":"Пауза","views.main.play":"Воспроизвести","views.main.reset":"Сброс","views.main.timelogs":"Журнал","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Агент","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Статус","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Время","views.main.total_time_spent":"Полное время","views.modal.body_with_format":"Это суммарное время ({{time_format}}), затраченное вами на работу с данным тикетом. При необходимости измените время, затем нажмите кнопку «Сообщить время».","views.modal.close":"Отмена","views.modal.count_down":"Это окно автоматически закроется через {{time}} с.","views.modal.save":"Сообщить время","views.resume_modal.body":"Хотите запустить таймер снова?","views.resume_modal.no":"Нет","views.resume_modal.yes":"Да","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Экспортировать в CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"Нет журналов для отображения","views.timelogs.error":"Не удается загрузить журналы.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Скрыть журналы","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Показать журналы","views.timelogs.title":"Журнал"}},8041(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Getting started with the Time Tracking app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support account, then click the Admin icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps > Marketplace**, then find the Time Tracking app and click the tile.\n3. On the Time Tracking app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner. This app is only available to customers on the Professional and Enterprise plans.\n4. Enter a name for the app, select the configurations you want, then click **Install**.\n5. If you are using Ticket Forms (part of the Productivity Pack add-on), go to **Admin > Manage > Ticket Forms** and add the ticket fields 'Total time spent' and 'Time spent last update' to each of your Ticket Forms.\"","app.long_description":"* Automatically track the time spent on each of your Zendesk Support tickets\n* Customize the app to include the exact functionality that your team needs\n* Leverage Insights to create detailed reports with your time tracking data\n\nThe Time Tracking app makes managing your team's performance and overall support operations easier. Easily identify which customers send in the most complicated tickets, or which issue types take the longest for your team to resolve. Dig down into an agent's tickets to discover what's taking up their time and which issues they're experts on.\n\n### Know exactly how and where your team is spending their time\n\nKeep a running log of which support agents have worked on a ticket and how long each interaction lasted. Automatically log the total time spent the second your agent updates a ticket or let them manually enter their time.\n\n### Easy to setup, customize, and use\n\nThe Time Tracking App doesn't require any third party setup or login. Simply customize how the Time Tracking app displays and works for your support team, for a seamless fit into your team's current workflow.\n\n### Report on your time logs and take action\n\nStart reporting right away with easily built custom time tracking reports through Insights. Know exactly what's draining your support team's resources and find the best areas for optimization and improvement.\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).\"","app.name":"Sledovanie času","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"Časovač sa pozastaví, keď agent odíde od tiketu a bude pokračovať, keď sa agent k tiketu opäť vráti.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Automaticky pozastaviť","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blokuje odoslanie tiketu, ak sa agent pokúša odoslať tiket s hodnotou stráveného času (v sekundách) vyššou ako 1209600 s (dva týždne).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Odstraňovanie chýb: Blokovať odoslanie stráveného času s veľmi vysokou hodnotou","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agenti môžu vidieť na tiketoch aktivity so zaznamenaným časom.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Zobraziť časové záznamy agentom","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"Aplikácia sa nezobrazí agentom, ktorí nemajú rolu 'Admin'. Tiež to zabraňuje tomu, aby mohli vidieť a upravovať čas po odoslaní.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Skryť aplikáciu pred agentmi","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agenti môžu manuálne pozastaviť alebo resetovať časovač.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Display ovládacie prvky časovača","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agenti môžu resetovať aktuálny čas strávený nad tiketom.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Obnoviť aktuálny čas","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"Po vykonaní zmien v akomkoľvek poli sa zobrazí modálne okno s otázkou, či má časovač pokračovať.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Pokračovať v prípade zmien","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Agentom sa pred odoslaním tiketu zobrazí výzva, aby zadali hodnotu v minútach","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Zadať čas zjednodušene pred odoslaním","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"ID vlastného číselného poľa, ktoré bude obsahovať celkový čas.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"ID poľa času","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"ID vlastného číselného poľa, ktoré bude obsahovať čas strávený nad tiketom.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"ID poľa konfigurácie","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agenti môžu skontrolovať a upraviť svoj čas pred odoslaním tiketu.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Upraviť čas pred odoslaním","app.short_description":"Pomôže vám sledovať čas strávený nad tiketmi.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Neplatný formát času, očakáva sa {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Čas bol záporný. Nastavené na 0.","errors.no_answer":"Nebol odoslaný žiadny čas","errors.save_hook":"Musíte odoslať čas, ktorý ste strávili nad týmto tiketom.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Postupovali ste podľa pokynov na inštaláciu pre túto aplikáciu a nakonfigurovali obe požadované polia tiketu, aby sa objavili v každom formulári tiketu?","errors.setup.solution":'Ak nie, prečítajte si <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">tieto pokyny</a> a prejdite na stránku spravovania formulárov tiketov, aby ste dokončili nastavenie.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"Odoslaný čas bol príliš dlhý.","statuses.closed":"u","statuses.hold":"p","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"č","statuses.solved":"v",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minúty","views.main.pause":"Pozastaviť","views.main.play":"Play","views.main.reset":"Resetovať","views.main.timelogs":"Zaznamenaný čas","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Stav","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Čas","views.main.total_time_spent":"Celkový čas","views.modal.body_with_format":"Toto je čas vo formáte {{time_format}}, ktorý ste strávili nad týmto tiketom. Ak je to potrebné, upravte čas a kliknite na položku „Odoslať čas“.","views.modal.close":"Zrušiť","views.modal.count_down":"Toto okno sa automaticky zatvorí o {{time}} s.","views.modal.save":"Odoslať čas","views.resume_modal.body":"Chceli by ste obnoviť časovač?","views.resume_modal.no":"Nie","views.resume_modal.yes":"Áno","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Exportovať vo formáte CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"Žiadne zaznamenané časy na zobrazenie","views.timelogs.error":"Nemôžeme načítať žiadne zaznamenané časy.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Skryť zaznamenané časy","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Zobraziť zaznamenané časy","views.timelogs.title":"Zaznamenané časy"}},5760(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Getting started with the Time Tracking app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support account, then click the Admin icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps > Marketplace**, then find the Time Tracking app and click the tile.\n3. On the Time Tracking app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner. This app is only available to customers on the Professional and Enterprise plans.\n4. Enter a name for the app, select the configurations you want, then click **Install**.\n5. If you are using Ticket Forms (part of the Productivity Pack add-on), go to **Admin > Manage > Ticket Forms** and add the ticket fields 'Total time spent' and 'Time spent last update' to each of your Ticket Forms.\"","app.long_description":"* Automatically track the time spent on each of your Zendesk Support tickets\n* Customize the app to include the exact functionality that your team needs\n* Leverage Insights to create detailed reports with your time tracking data\n\nThe Time Tracking app makes managing your team's performance and overall support operations easier. Easily identify which customers send in the most complicated tickets, or which issue types take the longest for your team to resolve. Dig down into an agent's tickets to discover what's taking up their time and which issues they're experts on.\n\n### Know exactly how and where your team is spending their time\n\nKeep a running log of which support agents have worked on a ticket and how long each interaction lasted. Automatically log the total time spent the second your agent updates a ticket or let them manually enter their time.\n\n### Easy to setup, customize, and use\n\nThe Time Tracking App doesn't require any third party setup or login. Simply customize how the Time Tracking app displays and works for your support team, for a seamless fit into your team's current workflow.\n\n### Report on your time logs and take action\n\nStart reporting right away with easily built custom time tracking reports through Insights. Know exactly what's draining your support team's resources and find the best areas for optimization and improvement.\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).\"","app.name":"Time Tracking","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"The timer pauses when the agent navigates away from the ticket and resumes when the agent is back on the ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Auto pause","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blocks submission of a ticket if an agent is trying to submit a ticket with a time spent value (in seconds) greater than 1209600s (two weeks).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Debug: Block large time spent submissions","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agents can see timelog activity on tickets.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Display timelogs to agents","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"The app will not be shown to agents who do not have the 'Admin' role. This also prevents them from being able to see & edit the time upon submission.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Hide the app from agents","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agents can manually pause or reset the timer.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Display timer controls","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agents can reset the current time spent on a ticket.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Reset current time","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"When changes are made to any fields, a modal will ask if the timer should be resumed.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Resume on changes","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Prompt agents to enter a value in minutes before submitting the ticket","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Simplified time submission","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the total time.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Time Field ID","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the time spent on ticket.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Configuration Field ID","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agents can review and edit their time before submitting the ticket.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Edit time submission","app.short_description":"Helps you track time spent on tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Invalid time format, expected {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Time was negative. Resetting to 0.","errors.no_answer":"No time submitted","errors.save_hook":"You need to submit your time on this ticket.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Did you follow the installation instructions for this app and configure both required ticket fields to appear on every ticket form?","errors.setup.solution":'If not, please see <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> and go to your ticket forms management page to finalize the setup.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"The time submitted was too long.","statuses.closed":"c","statuses.hold":"h","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutes","views.main.pause":"Pause","views.main.play":"Play","views.main.reset":"Reset","views.main.timelogs":"Timelog","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Time","views.main.total_time_spent":"Total time","views.modal.body_with_format":'This is the amount of time ({{time_format}}) you spent on this ticket. Edit the time, if needed, and then click "Submit time".',"views.modal.close":"Cancel","views.modal.count_down":"This modal will automatically close in {{time}} seconds.","views.modal.save":"Submit time","views.resume_modal.body":"Would you like to resume the timer?","views.resume_modal.no":"No","views.resume_modal.yes":"Yes","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Export CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"No timelogs to display","views.timelogs.error":"We are unable to load any timelogs.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Hide timelogs","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Show timelogs","views.timelogs.title":"Timelogs"}},3095(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Getting started with the Time Tracking app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support account, then click the Admin icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps > Marketplace**, then find the Time Tracking app and click the tile.\n3. On the Time Tracking app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner. This app is only available to customers on the Professional and Enterprise plans.\n4. Enter a name for the app, select the configurations you want, then click **Install**.\n5. If you are using Ticket Forms (part of the Productivity Pack add-on), go to **Admin > Manage > Ticket Forms** and add the ticket fields 'Total time spent' and 'Time spent last update' to each of your Ticket Forms.\"","app.long_description":"* Automatically track the time spent on each of your Zendesk Support tickets\n* Customize the app to include the exact functionality that your team needs\n* Leverage Insights to create detailed reports with your time tracking data\n\nThe Time Tracking app makes managing your team's performance and overall support operations easier. Easily identify which customers send in the most complicated tickets, or which issue types take the longest for your team to resolve. Dig down into an agent's tickets to discover what's taking up their time and which issues they're experts on.\n\n### Know exactly how and where your team is spending their time\n\nKeep a running log of which support agents have worked on a ticket and how long each interaction lasted. Automatically log the total time spent the second your agent updates a ticket or let them manually enter their time.\n\n### Easy to setup, customize, and use\n\nThe Time Tracking App doesn't require any third party setup or login. Simply customize how the Time Tracking app displays and works for your support team, for a seamless fit into your team's current workflow.\n\n### Report on your time logs and take action\n\nStart reporting right away with easily built custom time tracking reports through Insights. Know exactly what's draining your support team's resources and find the best areas for optimization and improvement.\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).\"","app.name":"Time Tracking","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"The timer pauses when the agent navigates away from the ticket and resumes when the agent is back on the ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Auto pause","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blocks submission of a ticket if an agent is trying to submit a ticket with a time spent value (in seconds) greater than 1209600s (two weeks).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Debug: Block large time spent submissions","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agents can see timelog activity on tickets.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Display timelogs to agents","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"The app will not be shown to agents who do not have the 'Admin' role. This also prevents them from being able to see & edit the time upon submission.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Hide the app from agents","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agents can manually pause or reset the timer.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Display timer controls","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agents can reset the current time spent on a ticket.","app.parameters.reset.label":"Reset current time","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.helpText":"When changes are made to any fields, a modal will ask if the timer should be resumed.","app.parameters.resume_on_changes.label":"Resume on changes","app.parameters.simple_submission.helpText":"Prompt agents to enter a value in minutes before submitting the ticket","app.parameters.simple_submission.label":"Simplified time submission","app.parameters.time_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the total time.","app.parameters.time_field_id.label":"Time Field ID","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.helpText":"The ID of a custom numeric field that will hold the time spent on ticket.","app.parameters.time_object_field_id.label":"Configuration Field ID","app.parameters.time_submission.helpText":"Agents can review and edit their time before submitting the ticket.","app.parameters.time_submission.label":"Edit time submission","app.short_description":"Helps you track time spent on tickets.","errors.bad_time_with_format":"Invalid time format, expected {{time_format}}.","errors.negative_time":"Time was negative. Resetting to 0.","errors.no_answer":"No time submitted","errors.save_hook":"You need to submit your time on this ticket.","errors.setup.contact_admin":"You don't have access to update ticket forms. An admin can fix this by opening the Time Tracking app from this ticket.","errors.setup.failed_heading":"Following ticket forms failed to update","errors.setup.failed_manual":'Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to add the missing fields to these forms manually.',"errors.setup.fix_button":"Add missing fields","errors.setup.fix_failed":'The fields couldn\'t be added. Follow <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> to update your ticket forms manually.',"errors.setup.fixed_reload":"Reload your browser to apply these changes.","errors.setup.question":"Did you follow the installation instructions for this app and configure both required ticket fields to appear on every ticket form?","errors.setup.solution":'If not, please see <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank">these instructions</a> and go to your ticket forms management page to finalize the setup.',"errors.setup.updated_heading":"Following ticket forms updated successfully","errors.setup.warning_heading":"Some other ticket forms are missing required fields. Time tracking may not work correctly on tickets that use those forms.","errors.time_too_large":"The time submitted was too long.","statuses.closed":"c","statuses.hold":"h","statuses.new":"n","statuses.open":"o","statuses.pending":"p","statuses.solved":"s",time_format_hms:"HH:mm:ss",time_format_minutes:"minutes","views.main.pause":"Pause","views.main.play":"Play","views.main.reset":"Reset","views.main.timelogs":"Timelog","views.main.timelogs_table.agent":"Agent","views.main.timelogs_table.status":"Status","views.main.timelogs_table.time":"Time","views.main.total_time_spent":"Total time","views.modal.body_with_format":'This is the amount of time ({{time_format}}) you spent on this ticket. Edit the time, if needed, and then click "Submit time".',"views.modal.close":"Cancel","views.modal.count_down":"This modal will automatically close in {{time}} seconds.","views.modal.save":"Submit time","views.resume_modal.body":"Would you like to resume the timer?","views.resume_modal.no":"No","views.resume_modal.yes":"Yes","views.timelogs.csv_export":"Export CSV","views.timelogs.empty":"No timelogs to display","views.timelogs.error":"We are unable to load any timelogs.","views.timelogs.hide_timelogs":"Hide timelogs","views.timelogs.show_timelogs":"Show timelogs","views.timelogs.title":"Timelogs"}},4487(e){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Getting started with the Time Tracking app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support account, then click the Admin icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps > Marketplace**, then find the Time Tracking app and click the tile.\n3. On the Time Tracking app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner. This app is only available to customers on the Professional and Enterprise plans.\n4. Enter a name for the app, select the configurations you want, then click **Install**.\n5. If you are using Ticket Forms (part of the Productivity Pack add-on), go to **Admin > Manage > Ticket Forms** and add the ticket fields 'Total time spent' and 'Time spent last update' to each of your Ticket Forms.\"","app.long_description":"* Automatically track the time spent on each of your Zendesk Support tickets\n* Customize the app to include the exact functionality that your team needs\n* Leverage Insights to create detailed reports with your time tracking data\n\nThe Time Tracking app makes managing your team's performance and overall support operations easier. Easily identify which customers send in the most complicated tickets, or which issue types take the longest for your team to resolve. Dig down into an agent's tickets to discover what's taking up their time and which issues they're experts on.\n\n### Know exactly how and where your team is spending their time\n\nKeep a running log of which support agents have worked on a ticket and how long each interaction lasted. Automatically log the total time spent the second your agent updates a ticket or let them manually enter their time.\n\n### Easy to setup, customize, and use\n\nThe Time Tracking App doesn't require any third party setup or login. Simply customize how the Time Tracking app displays and works for your support team, for a seamless fit into your team's current workflow.\n\n### Report on your time logs and take action\n\nStart reporting right away with easily built custom time tracking reports through Insights. Know exactly what's draining your support team's resources and find the best areas for optimization and improvement.\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).\"","app.name":"Time Tracking","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.helpText":"Allows submission of a ticket with a time spent value of 00:00:00 as time spent on a follow-up ticket.","app.parameters.allow_zero_in_follow_up_ticket.label":"Allow 00:00:00 as time spent on follow-up tickets","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.helpText":"The timer pauses when the agent navigates away from the ticket and resumes when the agent is back on the ticket.","app.parameters.auto_pause_resume.label":"Auto pause","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.helpText":"Blocks submission of a ticket if an agent is trying to submit a ticket with a time spent value (in seconds) greater than 1209600s (two weeks).","app.parameters.debug_prevent_huge_times.label":"Debug: Block large time spent submissions","app.parameters.display_timelogs.helpText":"Agents can see timelog activity on tickets.","app.parameters.display_timelogs.label":"Display timelogs to agents","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.helpText":"The app will not be shown to agents who do not have the 'Admin' role. This also prevents them from being able to see & edit the time upon submission.","app.parameters.hide_from_agents.label":"Hide the app from agents","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.helpText":"Agents can manually pause or reset the timer.","app.parameters.manual_pause_resume.label":"Display timer controls","app.parameters.reset.helpText":"Agents can reset the current time spent on a ticket.","app.parameter